# Cloak and Dagger, Entwined: "You may exile a nonland card from their hand or the chosen creature" - here no creature is
# chosen (the second target is "up to one", and Bot2 has no creature to offer) and Bot1 exiles one of Bot2's two Lightning Bolts (CR
# 610.3 until Cloak and Dagger leaves the battlefield); the lands in the hand are not on offer. Bot2's other Bolt kills
# Cloak and Dagger on turn 4 and the exiled one comes back to its owner's hand at once, not to the stack.

